1
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:09,980
The campus event that impressed me most was a charity fun run organized by our student union last spring.
给我留下印象最深的校园活动，是去年春天我们学生会组织的一场慈善趣味跑。

2
00:00:10,780 --> 00:00:18,590
Early on the morning of the race, more than a thousand students and teachers gathered at the stadium, all wearing the same bright orange T-shirts.
比赛当天一大早，一千多名学生和老师聚集在体育场，人人都穿着同样的亮橙色T恤。

3
00:00:19,390 --> 00:00:24,110
The five-kilometer route ran past the library, the lake and the classroom buildings.
五公里的路线经过图书馆、湖边和教学楼。

4
00:00:24,910 --> 00:00:31,590
Many runners wore funny hats and wigs, and volunteers along the way handed out water and cheered for everyone.
许多跑者戴着滑稽的帽子和假发，沿途的志愿者分发饮用水，并为每个人加油。

5
00:00:32,390 --> 00:00:36,960
I am not a strong runner, and by the fourth kilometer I was almost exhausted.
我跑步不算厉害，到第四公里时就几乎筋疲力尽了。

6
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:44,590
Just then, a classmate I hardly knew slowed down and ran beside me until we crossed the finish line together.
就在这时，一位我几乎不认识的同学放慢了速度，一直陪我并肩跑，直到我们一起冲过终点线。

7
00:00:45,390 --> 00:00:52,480
Later, all the money from registration fees was donated to a rural elementary school to build a small library.
后来，所有的报名费都捐给了一所农村小学，用来建一座小图书馆。

8
00:00:53,280 --> 00:00:58,130
The event impressed me not because of the race itself but because of the warmth it showed.
这次活动给我留下深刻印象，不是因为比赛本身，而是因为它所展现出的温暖。

9
00:00:58,930 --> 00:01:05,340
It taught me that a small act of kindness can mean a great deal, and it made me feel truly at home at my university.
它让我懂得，一个小小的善举可能意义重大，也让我在大学里真正有了家的感觉。
